</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 182.9)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:13.43em;--ltx-fo-height:7.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:12.22em;font-size:10pt;" height="278.36" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 109.24)" width="185.83"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.F12.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:13.43em;">
<span id="A1.F12.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F12.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Look at this image and identify the count of each object.
Provide your analysis step by step and ensure all details are clear.
Only use the following allowed objects: <span id="A1.F12.p1.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">apple, palm_tree, strawberry, egg, clover, donut, mushroom, acorn, lemon, football, flower, sheep, panda, muffin, apricot, eggplant, broccoli, rabbit, banana, rubber_duck, horse, fish, tomato, candy, ice_cream_cone, cake, orange, carrot</span>.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
          
</div></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<div id="A1.F12.3" class="ltx_logical-block ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:165.6pt;">
            
<div id="A1.F12.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.F12.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="186.53" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 229.14 186.53" width="229.14"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,186.53) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000080;" fill="#000080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 180.63 C 0 183.89 2.64 186.53 5.91 186.53 L 223.23 186.53 C 226.49 186.53 229.14 183.89 229.14 180.63 L 229.14 5.91 C 229.14 2.64 226.49 0 223.23 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2FF;" fill="#F2F2FF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 162.42 L 227.17 162.42 L 227.17 5.91 C 227.17 3.73 225.41 1.97 223.23 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 171.02)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:13.43em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="185.83"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
