<span id="A1.F13.p2.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">For example:</span> <span id="A1.F13.p2.pic1.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">apple,ice_cream_cone</span>.</span></span>
<span id="A1.F13.p2.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F13.p2.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Do not include additional text. Only use allowed object names.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
